/-!
# The value bounds of the fourteen points D_i (lane lean-m4box)

From the value certificates of the data files `K<k>I<i>.lean` (generated by code/local-group/di_value_certs_gen.lean,
checked by the kernel): the bounds `K<k>I<i>.cert` (`lamK_Dpt_of_cert`), `‖lamK k (D_i) j‖ ≤ 1` for all
`i, j`, hence `ChartLog k (lam k)` (`chartLog_of_values`), and the balls of lane M4, `HBallD` for `T0.data`,
`T1.data` (`hBallD_of_values`).
-/

